- Technical Details
    - Tech Stack:
        - Python 3, stdlib curses
    - Key Files:
        - picker: executable Python script
        - readme.log: usage and rationale
    - Architecture Notes:
        - dup2 dance: stdin/stdout get redirected to /dev/tty for the curses UI; the original stdout fd is restored before printing the result so $(picker ...) capture works
        - --custom adds one extra row that, on Enter, becomes an inline editable field

